  <div class="highlight-box highlight-box--gold">
    <p class="honest-take__label" style="color:#2dd4bf !important;">Play the longer game</p>
    <p>
      <strong>The real driver of long-term income is not one negotiation - it is building a genuine high-income skill portfolio that keeps unlocking better offers, raises, and roles over your whole career.</strong> Getting a fair first number matters, but a fresher who invests in the right skills, proof of work, and market positioning reaches financial freedom earlier than one who only negotiates well once and stops there.
